      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like \"stepping off\" is too subtle. like, what's the point of just being still when everything is empty? it's like i've invested everything i have into a game that just ended in a total loss. it feels more like the only way to actually stop the bleeding is to just quit the whole thing entirely.",
